<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39033" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏsēlytus</span></b> ,
			a, um, = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσήλυτος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>come from
				abroad</i>, <i>foreign</i>, <i>strange</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numeravit Salomon omnes viros proselytos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Par. 2, 17</span></i>
			.—Hence, as <i>subst.</i>,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏsēlytus</span></b> ,
			i, m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A sojourner</i>, <i>a stranger</i> in
			the land: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proselyti et advenae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Tob. 1, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				Ezech. 14, 7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp., <i>one that has come over from
				heathenism to the Jewish religion</i>, <i>a
				proselyte</i> (postclass.), <i><span class="en">Tert. adv.
				Marc. 3, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 64</span></i>,
			n. 8; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt. 23, 15</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Fabr. p. 465</span></i>, n.
			101.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏsēlyta</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>a female
			proselyte</i>, <i>converted woman</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 25, 22</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
